# Interface file for T1 acquisition-scale model
# Built from LiDAR profile: columns A(distance) and D(elevation), shifted so z_surf(x=0)=50 m.
# x range: 0-300 m; nx=600 at 0.5 m element width.
# IMPORTANT: only free-surface topography varies.
# Subsurface interfaces are assumed flat, so only the top slow layer has variable thickness.
#   interface 1: bottom z=0 m
#   interface 2: weathered/competent limestone boundary, flat z=33 m
#   interface 3: soil/weathered limestone boundary, flat z=47 m
#   interface 4: free surface from LiDAR
 4

